 "summary": "Three single Schottky barrier rectifiers in the SOD-123 plastic surface-mount package, rated 1 A average and 9 A surge. They differ in reverse voltage: 20 V (B5817W, marked SJ), 30 V (B5818W, SK) and 40 V (B5819W, SL), and in forward drop, 0.45 V, 0.55 V and 0.6 V maximum at 1 A. Applications: low-voltage high-frequency inverters, freewheeling and polarity protection.",
